        "title": "New iPad mini vs previous model: Here’s everything new",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/26/new-ipad-mini-vs-previous-model-heres-everything-new/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/ipad-mini-a20-pro-vs-a17-pro-new.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/26/new-ipad-mini-features-release-date-price/\">unveiled a new iPad mini</a> today, and it’s a big upgrade over the previous model. Here’s everything new.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ipad,ipad-mini\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1075754\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/26/new-ipad-mini-vs-previous-model-heres-everything-new/#more-1075754\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
