        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/23/apples-website-has-fun-new-easter-egg-a-fully-interactive-ipod/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/ipod-easter-egg-apple-25th-anniversary.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today is the 25th anniversary of Apple unveiling the first iPod. And as discovered <a href=\"https://x.com/kianworld/status/2113519872999301172?s=61&amp;t=a-bloX1n-TZ50ofqhetO1A\">by Kian on X</a>, the company’s website now has a fun new iPod easter egg.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ipod\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1075479\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/23/apples-website-has-fun-new-easter-egg-a-fully-interactive-ipod/#more-1075479\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
