        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/22/amazon-unveils-kindle-subscription-a-rebrand-with-more-audiobooks/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/kindle-plus.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today Amazon announced that its Kindle Unlimited subscription has been <a href=\"https://link.amazon/A0avbIEca\">rebranded ‘Kindle+’</a> and includes more audiobooks than before. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"amazon-kindle,kindle\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1075374\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/22/amazon-unveils-kindle-subscription-a-rebrand-with-more-audiobooks/#more-1075374\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
