        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/22/apple-tv-is-adding-two-new-features-with-ios-27-2/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/10/appl-tv-icon-26.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27.2 is <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/20/ios-27-2-adds-new-features-in-six-iphone-apps-heres-whats-coming/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1074929\">coming next week</a> and brings two new features for Apple TV subscribers. Here’s what’s new.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv,ios-27,ios-27-2\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1075341\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/22/apple-tv-is-adding-two-new-features-with-ios-27-2/#more-1075341\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
