        "title": "iPhone Duo adding Apple Pencil support next week with iOS 27.2",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/21/iphone-duo-adding-apple-pencil-support-next-week-with-ios-27-2/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/iphone-duo-apple-pencil.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone Duo reviews have arrived (<a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/21/iphone-duo-review/\">read our in-depth review here</a>). And a surprise bit of good news we’ve learned today is that Apple Pencil support on iPhone Duo will arrive much sooner than expected: it’s coming next week in iOS 27.2.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-pencil,iphone,iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1075145\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/21/iphone-duo-adding-apple-pencil-support-next-week-with-ios-27-2/#more-1075145\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
